# A OrthrosCode agent. What stays out of this folder's history.

# The Python environment SETUP.bat builds. Recreated from requirements.txt.
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp

# Written at runtime -- by this agent's own launcher, or by the other agent
# while it works on this folder: status, logs, the round prompt, aider's
# chat history, the dashboard's preferences. Includes .localcoder-managed,
# the marker that lets the other agent commit and roll back here; ignored so
# that a rollback can never remove it.
.localcoder*
.aider*
.localcoder-round.md
.localcoder-ralph.log
.localcoder-aider.log
.localcoder-status.json
.localcoder-stop
.localcoder-aider.log.1
